    "detailed_description": "Unending nightfall has swept across the forest, sending all the animals fleeing from monstrous shapes in the dark!<br><br>A last refuge, Light Springs, survives; and now it's time for you to chart the lost paths back into the forest!<br><br>Collect and use charms and glyphs of power to make your way through the forest, reconnect villages and help towns-critters as you work to solve the cause of the nightfall.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore:</strong> The forest is dark and filled with danger! Find the safest path for convoys to travel, and uncover long forgotten locations to help your journey!<br><br></li><li><strong>Scout:</strong> for nearby enemies and locations in each region. Use your intuition and skills to solve each map.<br><br></li><li><strong>Use:</strong> glyph powers to move and defeat enemies. Rolls glyphs against your challengers to unlock better dialogue paths.<br><br></li><li><strong>Customise:</strong> Grow your loadout of glyphs, find shrines and quests to make strategic upgrades to them as you travel.<br><br></li><li><strong>Quest:</strong> for towns-critters to improve your reputation and build convoys. Find side-quests in the forest for rich rewards.<br><br></li><li><strong>Journey:</strong> to different biomes and towns. Different enemies, challenges, and secrets you'll need to uncover to save the forest!</li></ul>",
